          "guid": "mt5lc7c0ndw8bdpf",
          "message": {
            "text": "The rebuilt CoreText helper and pinned Chromium 147.0.7727.15 agreed on 7/7 representative logical rows. Normal, bold, and italic PostScript identities were exact; live CoreText reports also carried the requested opsz, wght, and wdth coordinates, repeat browser reads were stable, and the dynamically selected Times Page.setFontFamilies control left system-ui unchanged.",
            "markdown": "The rebuilt CoreText helper and pinned Chromium 147.0.7727.15 agreed on 7/7 representative logical rows. Normal, bold, and italic PostScript identities were exact; live CoreText reports also carried the requested opsz, wght, and wdth coordinates, repeat browser reads were stable, and the dynamically selected Times Page.setFontFamilies control left system-ui unchanged."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/system-ui-preference-route-oracle.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 331,
                  "endLine": 351,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "async function runDarwinMode(mode: LaunchMode): Promise<ModeReport> {\n  invalidateFontEnvironmentCaches();\n  const result = await collectState(mode, \"coretext-live\", [], null);\n  const distinct = new Set(result.state.rows.map((row) => normalizeFace(faceId(row.browser))));\n  const active = distinct.size >= 3;\n  return {\n    id: mode.id,\n    engine: mode.engine,\n    headless: mode.headless,\n    browserVersions: [result.browserVersion],\n    states: [result.state],\n    preferenceMutation: {\n      kind: \"coretext-style-metric\",\n      before: faceId(result.state.rows.find((row) => row.id === \"text-normal\")?.browser ?? null),\n      after: faceId(result.state.rows.find((row) => row.id === \"bold\")?.browser ?? null),\n      active,\n    },\n    pass: result.state.pass && active,\n  };\n}\n"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
